{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-105","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与线段","englishTitle":"A straight line commensurable with a minor straight line is minor.","book":10,"number":105,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.105","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.105/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":105,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-105@raw-7cfe02a6404a8afe","contentId":"euclid-10-105","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7cfe02a6404a8afee9261e250ac8f98f00d6dea0f7a35458d8cd751aaaa91f89","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-105.statement","euclid-10-105.construction.1","euclid-10-105.construction.2","euclid-10-105.proof.1","euclid-10-105.proof.2","euclid-10-105.proof.3","euclid-10-105.proof.4","euclid-10-105.proof.5","euclid-10-105.proof.6","euclid-10-105.conclusion","euclid-10-105.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-105.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-105","revisionId":"euclid-10-105@raw-7cfe02a6404a8afe","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"096a15e7f084362f3066bf04211e79be618d7449739af835a7523c82ae13f3ea","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"A straight line commensurable with a minor straight line is minor."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"直线可公度与小直线是次要的。（相关点与线段：A）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-105.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-105","revisionId":"euclid-10-105@raw-7cfe02a6404a8afe","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"df2c95ced4b80b22dc72a07ae37622c7843082a9ad829eb38f75ee1132659c96","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be a minor straight line, and CD commensurable with AB; I say that CD is also minor."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB线成为一条小直线,CD 可公度和AB;我说CD也是小线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-105.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-105","revisionId":"euclid-10-105@raw-7cfe02a6404a8afe","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7a01cb66d0bd98256bff7acd0fcbcc92c39962a5959434a839a7c6532fcf5891","citations":["euclid-10-76","euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the same construction be made as before; then, since AE, EB are incommensurable in square, [[X. 76](/principles/euclid-10-76)] therefore CF, FD are also incommensurable in square. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"工程工程和以前一样,自AE以来,正方形个工程为不可公度个,因此CF工程为个工程为不可公度个工程。（相关点与线段：EB、FD） [[X. 76](/principles/euclid-10-76)] [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-105.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-105","revisionId":"euclid-10-105@raw-7cfe02a6404a8afe","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0f31dbae6d53a9b41d40d88d8c1255f17dba975790a5fa6531dc45459b0503c3","citations":["euclid-5-12","euclid-5-16","euclid-6-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now since, as AE is to EB, so is CF to FD, [[V. 12](/principles/euclid-5-12), [V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)] therefore also, as the square on AE is to the square on EB, so is the square on CF to the square on FD. [[VI. 22](/principles/euclid-6-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AE对EB的比等于CF对FD的比,EB对AE对正方形的比等于CF对正方形的比；AE 与 EB 之比等于 CF 与 FD 之比。 [ [V. 12](/principles/euclid-5-12) [V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16) [[VI. 22](/principles/euclid-6-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-105.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-105","revisionId":"euclid-10-105@raw-7cfe02a6404a8afe","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b1922bc2003532124776c9bb2b36463a54589a82ab4ac4cb0b610625e2d7763a","citations":["euclid-5-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, componendo, as the squares on AE, EB are to the square on EB, so are the squares on CF, FD to the square on FD. [[V. 18](/principles/euclid-5-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AE和EB是正方形,EB和EB是共和,CF和FD是共和与正方形,FD和正方形。 [[V. 18](/principles/euclid-5-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-105.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-105","revisionId":"euclid-10-105@raw-7cfe02a6404a8afe","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"99c2918a4afc86ccbe04ca576f63f06c0d824de51044ffd17c598ae4e889abd3","citations":["euclid-5-16","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on BE is commensurable with the square on DF; therefore the sum of the squares on AE, EB is also commensurable with the sum of the squares on CF, FD. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BE的正方形是可公度,DF是正方形,AE是EB,可公度也是可公度,CF是年（相关点与线段：FD） [ [V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-105.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-105","revisionId":"euclid-10-105@raw-7cfe02a6404a8afe","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2cb7ec57c993e43037fbafe076cdcbac6188f494ffa15f67f67c87fee0321397","citations":["euclid-10-76","euclid-10-def-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the sum of the squares on AE, EB is rational; [[X. 76](/principles/euclid-10-76)] therefore the sum of the squares on CF, FD is also rational. [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AE和EB的正方形和有理是有理;因此,CF和FD的正方形和有理也是有理。 [[X. 76](/principles/euclid-10-76)] [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-105.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-105","revisionId":"euclid-10-105@raw-7cfe02a6404a8afe","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"abe7281bceadfc1bcb0364a1bc5763afda961d23be590f1e9db76d6e5e994997","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since, as the square on AE is to the rectangle AE, EB, so is the square on CF to the rectangle CF, FD, while the square on AE is commensurable with the square on CF, therefore the rectangle AE, EB is also commensurable with the rectangle CF, FD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于AE正方形为矩形 AE,EB为正方形为正方形为正方形为正方形为正方形为CF为FD为可公度为可公度为正方形为正方形为CF为可公度为矩形为EB为EB为矩形为可公度为号为可公度为号为矩形为FD为正方形为可公度为FD为正方形为正方形为可公度为可公度为正方形为FD为正方形为正方形为正方形为正方形为可公度为正方形"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-105.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-105","revisionId":"euclid-10-105@raw-7cfe02a6404a8afe","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0610072fd63a41b77cc86a8cea7df54cde2c79a79d9751b30ec5e7938ce62c7d","citations":["euclid-10-76","euclid-10-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the rectangle AE, EB is medial; [[X. 76](/principles/euclid-10-76)] therefore the rectangle CF, FD is also medial; [[X. 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-23)] therefore CF, FD are straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them rational, but the rectangle contained by them medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,矩形 AE,EB是中项无理线段;因此,矩形 CF,FD也是中项无理线段;因此,CF,FD是正方形的直线不可公度,有理占正方形总数的正方形,但矩形占中项无理线段。 [[X. 76](/principles/euclid-10-76)] [[X. 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-105.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-105","revisionId":"euclid-10-105@raw-7cfe02a6404a8afe","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f965f4dbd637dd238e9f1f985adb81b7098626fedc9a1dd12d650308e88d2c49","citations":["euclid-10-76"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore CD is minor. [[X. 76](/principles/euclid-10-76)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,CD是未成年人。 Q. E,D。 [[X. 76](/principles/euclid-10-76)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-105.source","contentId":"euclid-10-105","revisionId":"euclid-10-105@raw-7cfe02a6404a8afe","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1bbce50361eacdac28ab4e008a1b8830df4565cce59a22d4e3f19e37af57b730","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.105/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.105\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-105:eu